			"notes": "New functionality: Notes. Now, when you send a message to yourself, it is saved in your personal notes. You can save up to 100 notes. Encryption of saved data has also been added. Now all player data is stored in encrypted form!\n\nNew commands:\n- `/pm notes [page]` - view the list of your notes\n- `/pm notes pin <index>` - pin a note\n- `/pm notes remove <index>` - delete a note\n- `/pm notes remove <from> <to>` - delete notes in the range\n- `/pm notes clear` - delete all notes\n- `/pm notes search <keyword>` - notes search"
		},
