			"notes": "### v2.0\n\n- Added offline message functional. Players can now send messages to any player, that have been on server. To read offline messages players can use `/pm read` command\n- Added messages history. Players can see last 20 messages using `/pm history` command. To clear history players can use `/pm clear`\n- Added languages support. Supported languages: English, Russian. If you want support for your language and can help me with it, create an issue and I will contact you"
